      "title": "Pak announces minister Musadik Malik would attend SCO meeting in India",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/world-news/pak-announces-minister-musadik-malik-would-attend-sco-meeting-in-india-126111401113_1.html",
      "description": "Pakistan announced on Saturday that Climate Change Minister Musadik Malik would participate in the Shanghai Cooperation Organisation (SCO) Civilisational Dialogue in India later this month.\nThe key meeting of the SCO nations would be held in New Delhi from November 20-22.\nIndia had announced on October 28 that invitations had been extended to all SCO members in keeping with established practice.\nAccording to the Pakistan Foreign Office, the event would bring representatives from SCO member states to discuss issues related to civilisational dialogue and cultural understanding.\n\"The government of Pakistan remains committed to promoting dialogue among civilisations and fostering people-to-people contacts within the SCO framework in a spirit of mutual respect,\" the statement said.\nMusadik Malik is a key minister who frequently appears on talk shows to present the official version of the government.\nHis participation in the event hosted by India shows that Pakistan wants to ease tensi",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-11-14T13:26:20"
